1030
00:44:26.970 --> 00:44:29.650
And that's why he's an accountant, which he is not.

1031
00:44:30.050 --> 00:44:30.810
That's right.

1032
00:44:31.150 --> 00:44:34.330
None of us really know what Creed does, and clearly Creed does not either.

1033
00:44:34.950 --> 00:44:39.770
Clark and Todd Packer, who are sitting out at the desks, they're not in the conference room,

1034
