1058
00:45:38.930 --> 00:45:42.650
What does your favorite cupcake flavor say about you?

1059
00:45:42.790 --> 00:45:43.250
Oh, no.

1060
00:45:44.330 --> 00:45:44.710
All right.

1061
00:45:44.810 --> 00:45:45.330
