1062
00:45:46.010 --> 00:45:50.990
Angela, when I asked you what kind of cupcake you like, you said vanilla.

1063
00:45:52.570 --> 00:45:57.130
And that means you are, quote, the boring friend who doesn't know how to text.

1064
00:45:58.190 --> 00:46:00.670
F*** you, SpoonUniversity.com.

1065
00:46:01.590 --> 00:46:03.010
But not wrong.

1066
00:46:03.830 --> 00:46:05.450
I know how to text.

1067
00:46:05.730 --> 00:46:07.270
What is wrong with my texting?

1068
00:46:07.430 --> 00:46:08.810
