Well, this is true, but it goes on to say, unfortunately, Angela, you're unoriginal.

1070
00:46:14.690 --> 00:46:15.650
But it's okay.

1071
00:46:15.770 --> 00:46:17.350
It says it's okay.

1072
00:46:17.450 --> 00:46:21.270
We're all a little unoriginal and like to stick to the basics sometimes.

1073
