If this is your classic cupcake order, you just like simplicity.

1074
00:46:26.370 --> 00:46:30.190
I wish my life was as easy as this cupcake, is what you're saying.

1075
00:46:30.190 --> 00:46:34.470
You crave simplicity, so you keep it simple with your cupcakes.

1076
00:46:34.750 --> 00:46:37.130
I'm sorry, but unoriginal.

1077
00:46:38.390 --> 00:46:40.430
Sounds like someone's throwing shade.

1078
00:46:41.630 --> 00:46:42.370
I'm sorry.

1079
00:46:42.470 --> 00:46:43.450
This is just what it said.

1080
00:46:44.490 --> 00:46:50.130
Cassie, you said in your email that you do not love cupcakes, which is very on brand for you.

1081
00:46:50.250 --> 00:46:53.550
But when forced to choose, you chose red velvet.

1082
00:46:54.630 --> 00:46:58.930
This means that you are, quote, the one who's going to grow up to be a surgeon.

1083
00:46:59.570 --> 00:46:59.770
What?

1084
00:47:01.450 --> 00:47:04.110
Spoon University is full of shit.

1085
00:47:04.430 --> 00:47:04.670
Those two are so different.

1086
00:47:04.990 --> 00:47:05.330
I know.

1087
00:47:05.790 --> 00:47:09.430
It says, red velvet cupcakes mean business.

1088
00:47:09.430 --> 00:47:12.370
You're slick and smooth and well-dressed.

1089
00:47:12.590 --> 00:47:18.450
That moist cupcake and cream cheese frosting mesh together so well, just like your life seems to.

1090
00:47:18.450 --> 00:47:20.870
Can we, Cassie, will you just say what you're wearing today?

1091
00:47:21.090 --> 00:47:21.490
Yeah.

1092
00:47:21.750 --> 00:47:24.810
I'm wearing slides and basketball shorts.

1093
00:47:24.970 --> 00:47:27.870
I am, like, the worst dressed one today.

1094
00:47:29.610 --> 00:47:31.390
Not according to your cupcake.

1095
00:47:32.070 --> 00:47:32.490
All right.

1096
00:47:32.870 --> 00:47:36.510
Sam and I both chose chocolate with vanilla frosting.

1097
00:47:37.390 --> 00:47:37.950
Sam.

1098
00:47:38.190 --> 00:47:38.510
Okay.

1099
00:47:38.710 --> 00:47:41.030
You and I are, quote, the fake hipster.

1100
00:47:41.330 --> 00:47:41.570
Okay.

1101
00:47:42.070 --> 00:47:42.370
Damn.

1102
00:47:42.650 --> 00:47:45.050
Spoon University hates all of us.

1103
