1104
00:47:46.290 --> 00:47:47.550
Okay, it's...

1105
00:47:47.550 --> 00:47:49.710
Jenna, do you run Spoon?

1106
00:47:49.890 --> 00:47:50.710
No, I do not.

1107
00:47:50.810 --> 00:47:51.730
I do not.

1108
00:47:51.890 --> 00:47:53.250
But here's what it says.

1109
00:47:53.430 --> 00:48:00.010
It says, if a chocolate cupcake with vanilla frosting is a regular in your diet, you're probably pretty basic, too.

1110
00:48:00.330 --> 00:48:00.750
Jesus.

1111
00:48:01.490 --> 00:48:05.570
You just get the chocolate cupcake to pretend you're more edgy.

1112
00:48:05.630 --> 00:48:06.910
Who hurt this person?

1113
00:48:07.070 --> 00:48:07.570
I don't know.

1114
00:48:07.630 --> 00:48:10.850
I think whoever wrote this doesn't like anyone.

1115
00:48:11.150 --> 00:48:11.410
Yeah.

1116
00:48:11.530 --> 00:48:11.690
Yeah.

1117
00:48:12.630 --> 00:48:13.290
All right.

1118
00:48:13.530 --> 00:48:19.470
Now, Sam, in your email, you were trying to decide between chocolate with vanilla frosting and Oreo.

1119
00:48:19.690 --> 00:48:20.170
Yeah, that's right.

1120
00:48:20.510 --> 00:48:23.150
Angela, is there any chance you would go Oreo?

1121
00:48:23.490 --> 00:48:23.830
No.

1122
00:48:24.650 --> 00:48:25.130
Okay.

1123
00:48:25.590 --> 00:48:25.950
No.

1124
